<context_preferences>
- Requested output_format: "{{ output_format }}"
- Requested detail_level: "{{ detail_level }}"
{% if detail_level == "summary" %}
- Depth guidance: keep narrative tight and focused on headline figures.
{% elif detail_level == "medium" %}
- Depth guidance: include concise rationale per workstream or milestone.
{% elif detail_level == "detailed" %}
- Depth guidance: surface explicit scope boundaries, dependencies, and risk mitigations.
{% endif %}
</context_preferences>

<rules>
- Do not invent stakeholders, deadlines, or budgets that the description does not provide.
- If the description is too vague to size reliably, set confidence_pct < 30 and start summary with "Out of scope:".
- Always answer in English regardless of the language of the description.
{% if metadata is defined and metadata is not none %}
- Treat conversation history and project_metadata as established context; produce an updated full estimation when scope evolves, not a delta.
{% endif %}
</rules>

